#: src/Admin/AdminMenu.php:213
msgid "Rename or recolour the statuses FluentCart ships with. The stored slug never changes, so nothing else in FluentCart is affected — leave a field blank to keep the original."
msgstr "改 FluentCart 內建狀態的名稱與顏色。資料庫裡存的代碼不會變，因此不影響 FluentCart 其他功能；欄位留空即維持原本的名稱。"

#: src/Admin/AdminMenu.php:219
msgid "Payment statuses"
msgstr "付款狀態"

#: src/Admin/AdminMenu.php:221
msgid "Payment statuses can be renamed but not added to: FluentCart decides download access, refunds, customer lifetime value and every revenue report from this column using hardcoded lists, so a new value would go quietly missing from all of them."
msgstr "付款狀態只能改名，不能新增：FluentCart 用寫死的清單依這個欄位判斷下載權限、退款、顧客終身價值與所有營收報表，新增的值會在這些地方無聲地消失。"

#: src/Admin/AdminMenu.php:234
msgid "This report lives here rather than under FluentCart → Reports because FluentCart 1.6 has no way to register a report page: its report screens are compiled Vue components and the only report filters it exposes belong to the traffic-source report. Everything below is read straight from the orders table, so the numbers match what you see when you filter the Orders list by the same status."
msgstr "這份報表放在這裡而不是 FluentCart → Reports，是因為 FluentCart 1.6 沒有註冊報表頁的機制：它的報表畫面是編譯過的 Vue 元件，對外開放的報表 filter 只作用於來源（UTM）報表。以下數字全部直接讀訂單資料表，所以會和你在訂單列表用同一個狀態篩選時看到的一致。"

#: src/Admin/AdminMenu.php:252
msgid "Orders placed from"
msgstr "訂單成立日期從"

#: src/Admin/AdminMenu.php:254
msgid "to"
msgstr "到"

#: src/Admin/AdminMenu.php:256
msgid "Refresh"
msgstr "重新整理"

#: src/Admin/AdminMenu.php:257
msgid "All time"
msgstr "全部期間"

#: src/Admin/AdminMenu.php:262
msgid "Workflow funnel"
msgstr "流程漏斗"

#: src/Admin/AdminMenu.php:263
msgid "How many orders are sitting on each step right now, whatever date range is selected above. Click a number to open the Orders list."
msgstr "目前停在每個步驟的訂單數，與上方日期範圍無關。點數字可以開啟訂單列表。"

#: src/Admin/AdminMenu.php:267
msgid "Orders and money per status, split by whether the money actually arrived. “Paid” means the payment status is paid, partially paid or partially refunded."
msgstr "各狀態的訂單數與金額，依「錢是否真的進來」分欄。「已付款」指付款狀態為 paid、partially_paid 或 partially_refunded。"

#: src/Admin/AdminMenu.php:269
#: src/Admin/AdminMenu.php:273
#: src/Admin/AdminMenu.php:278
#: src/Admin/AdminMenu.php:282
msgid "Download CSV"
msgstr "下載 CSV"

#: src/Admin/AdminMenu.php:275
msgid "Time in each status"
msgstr "各狀態停留時間"

#: src/Admin/AdminMenu.php:276
msgid "Measured from this plugin's own status history, and counting only stays that have ended — an order still sitting on a step has not finished its stay, so it is listed below instead."
msgstr "資料來自本外掛自己的狀態歷程，且只計算已經結束的停留——還停在某個步驟的訂單尚未結束停留，會列在下方的逾時清單。"

#: src/Admin/AdminMenu.php:280
msgid "Stuck orders"
msgstr "卡住的訂單"

#: src/Admin/AdminMenu.php:300
#: src/Admin/OrderWidget.php:146
msgid "Order workflow"
msgstr "訂單流程"

#: src/Admin/AdminMenu.php:304
msgid "Strict workflow — an order may only move to the next or previous step"
msgstr "嚴格流程——訂單只能切換到下一個或上一個步驟"

#: src/Admin/AdminMenu.php:308
msgid "Skipping a step is refused with a message naming the step that was missed. Moving an order out of the workflow entirely — completing, cancelling or putting it on hold — is always allowed, and so is moving an order into the workflow from outside it."
msgstr "跳階會被拒絕，並在訊息中說明漏掉哪一步。把訂單移出流程（完成、取消、改成待處理）永遠允許；從流程外進入流程也永遠允許。"

#: src/Admin/AdminMenu.php:313
msgid "Report an order as stuck after"
msgstr "訂單停在同一步驟超過"

#: src/Admin/AdminMenu.php:315
msgid "day(s) on the same step"
msgstr "天就列為卡住"

#: src/Admin/AdminMenu.php:319
#: src/Admin/OrderWidget.php:166
msgid "Status history"
msgstr "狀態歷程"

#: src/Admin/AdminMenu.php:321
msgid "Every status change is recorded from now on. Orders that changed status before this plugin was installed can be recovered from FluentCart's own activity log — it stores each change as a sentence, so this is best effort and lines it cannot read are skipped and counted."
msgstr "從現在起每次狀態變更都會被記錄。安裝本外掛之前的變更可以從 FluentCart 自己的活動紀錄回填——它是用一句話記錄每次變更，所以只能盡力解析，讀不出來的行會被跳過並計數。"

#: src/Admin/AdminMenu.php:324
msgid "Import history from the activity log"
msgstr "從活動紀錄回填歷程"

#: src/Admin/AdminMenu.php:328
msgid "Daily summary e-mail"
msgstr "每日摘要信"

#: src/Admin/AdminMenu.php:332
msgid "Send a daily summary of the workflow and the stuck orders"
msgstr "每天寄送流程概況與卡住訂單清單"

#: src/Admin/AdminMenu.php:336
msgid "Send it to"
msgstr "寄送到"

#: src/Admin/AdminMenu.php:340
msgid "Sent once a day by WP-Cron, with a catch-up on the next admin page load if cron did not fire — which on a quiet shop it often does not. Save your changes before sending a test."
msgstr "由 WP-Cron 每天寄一次；若 cron 沒有觸發（流量少的商店很常發生），會在下次進後台時補寄。測試寄送前請先儲存設定。"

#: src/Admin/AdminMenu.php:343
msgid "Send one now"
msgstr "立刻寄一封"

#: src/Admin/AdminMenu.php:346
msgid "Payment behaviour"
msgstr "付款後行為"

#: src/Admin/AdminMenu.php:350
msgid "Restore custom order statuses that FluentCart overwrites when a payment is recorded"
msgstr "當 FluentCart 因收到款項覆寫自訂訂單狀態時，自動還原"

#: src/Admin/AdminMenu.php:354
msgid "Applies per status, to the ones set to “Keep after payment”. Switch this off to let FluentCart move every paid order to Processing as it normally would."
msgstr "只作用於設為「付款後保留」的狀態。關閉後，所有已付款訂單都會照 FluentCart 原本的行為變成「處理中」。"

#: src/Admin/AdminMenu.php:357
msgid "Before you deactivate"
msgstr "停用前請先確認"

#: src/Admin/AdminMenu.php:359
msgid "Deactivating this plugin does not change a single order row — orders sitting on a custom status keep it, and FluentCart simply shows the raw slug. To clear them out first, move each custom status's orders to a built-in one with the Move button on its row."
msgstr "停用本外掛不會更動任何一筆訂單資料——停在自訂狀態的訂單會保留原值，FluentCart 只會直接顯示代碼。若要先清空，請用各狀態列上的「搬移訂單」按鈕把訂單改到內建狀態。"

#: src/Admin/AdminMenu.php:363
msgid "Export / import"
msgstr "匯出／匯入"

#: src/Admin/AdminMenu.php:365
msgid "Download JSON"
msgstr "下載 JSON"

#: src/Admin/AdminMenu.php:368
msgid "Paste an exported file to replace every status below:"
msgstr "貼上匯出的檔案內容，以取代下方所有狀態設定："

