#: src/Admin/AdminMenu.php:447
msgid "Creating the workflow…"
msgstr "建立流程中…"

#: src/Admin/AdminMenu.php:448
msgid "Read FluentCart's activity log and rebuild the imported history? Changes recorded since the plugin was installed are kept as they are."
msgstr "要讀取 FluentCart 的活動紀錄並重建回填的歷程嗎？外掛安裝後自行記錄的變更不會被更動。"

#: src/Admin/AdminMenu.php:449
