msgstr "這個商店有一種以上的幣別（%s）。下方金額是直接加總儲存值，沒有做匯率換算。"

#: src/Admin/AdminMenu.php:476
msgid "No status history has been recorded yet, so the timings below are empty. Import the history from the activity log on the Tools tab, or wait for the next status change."
msgstr "目前還沒有任何狀態歷程，所以下方的時間是空的。可以到「工具」分頁從活動紀錄回填，或等下一次狀態變更。"

#: src/Admin/OrderWidget.php:167
msgid "Every order and shipping status this order has been through, and how long it stayed."
msgstr "這筆訂單經過的每個訂單狀態與出貨狀態，以及各自停留多久。"

