#. translators: 1: required FluentCart version, 2: installed FluentCart version
#: src/Bootstrap.php:130
#, php-format
msgid "YS FluentCart Order Statuses needs FluentCart %1$s or newer. FluentCart %2$s is installed, so custom statuses are switched off. Orders already sitting on a custom status keep their value."
msgstr "YS FluentCart Order Statuses 需要 FluentCart %1$s 或更新版本，目前安裝的是 %2$s，因此自訂狀態已停用。已停在自訂狀態的訂單會保留原值。"

#. translators: %s: required FluentCart version
#: src/Bootstrap.php:136
#, php-format
msgid "YS FluentCart Order Statuses needs FluentCart %s or newer to be active. Custom statuses are switched off until then."
msgstr "YS FluentCart Order Statuses 需要啟用 FluentCart %s 或更新版本，在那之前自訂狀態不會生效。"

#. translators: %s: status label
