#: src/Admin/AdminMenu.php:137
msgid "Every status you add here is offered on every order, paid or not. FluentCart rewrites the order status to “Processing” the moment a payment is recorded — that is hardcoded in core and has no filter — so this plugin writes your status straight back, with a line in the order activity. Both behaviours can be changed per status under Advanced. Workflow steps that are really about fulfilment fit better on the Shipping statuses tab, where nothing overwrites them."
msgstr "你在這裡新增的每個狀態，所有訂單都能使用，不分付款與否。FluentCart 收到款項的當下會把訂單狀態改寫成「處理中」——這段寫死在核心、沒有 filter——所以本外掛會立刻把你的狀態寫回去，並在訂單活動紀錄留下一行說明。這兩種行為都可以在每個狀態的「進階」裡調整。屬於出貨流程的步驟，放在「出貨狀態」分頁會更合適，那裡的狀態不會被任何東西覆寫。"

#: src/Admin/AdminMenu.php:144
msgid "Step 1 is the built-in “Processing” status, which FluentCart writes as soon as a payment is recorded. The steps after it are the custom statuses below, in the order they are listed here. That order is how the Order workflow control on each order lists them, and what strict mode enforces."
msgstr "第 1 步是內建的「處理中」狀態，FluentCart 在收到款項的當下就會寫入它。後面的步驟就是下方的自訂狀態，順序照這裡的排列。每張訂單上的「訂單流程」控制項會照這個順序列出它們，嚴格模式也依這個順序判斷。"

#: src/Admin/AdminMenu.php:149
msgid "Adds “In production”, “Shipment scheduled” and “Shipped” (the last one also sets the shipping status), each offered on every order. FluentCart’s built-in statuses keep their own names, and nothing you have already set up is overwritten."
msgstr "加入「下生產」、「排定出貨」與「已出貨」（最後一個會同時設定出貨狀態），每一個都適用所有訂單。FluentCart 的內建狀態保留原本的名稱，已經設定好的內容也不會被覆寫。"

#: src/Admin/AdminMenu.php:178
msgid "Nothing in FluentCart writes the shipping status automatically — it changes only when someone changes it — and FluentCart’s own “Change Shipping Status” dialog lists the statuses you add here directly. This is the safest place for a multi-step fulfilment workflow, and the Tools tab will build one for you."
msgstr "FluentCart 不會自動寫入出貨狀態——只有人手動更改時才會變動——而且 FluentCart 自己的「變更出貨狀態」對話框會直接列出你在這裡新增的狀態。這是放多步驟出貨流程最安全的地方，「工具」分頁可以一鍵幫你建立。"

#: src/Admin/AdminMenu.php:289
msgid "If your workflow is about getting the goods out — made, packed, booked, shipped — put it on the shipping status. FluentCart never writes that column by itself, and its own “Change Shipping Status” dialog lists your custom steps directly. The order status is the other way round: FluentCart rewrites it to “Processing” whenever a payment lands, and its admin has no control for choosing an order status at all — only fixed buttons such as Mark As Complete and Cancel Order — so this plugin supplies both the guard and the control."
msgstr "如果你的流程是把商品送出去——製作、包裝、排單、出貨——請放在出貨狀態。FluentCart 永遠不會自己寫入那個欄位，而且它自己的「變更出貨狀態」對話框會直接列出你的自訂步驟。訂單狀態剛好相反：每次收到款項 FluentCart 都會把它改寫成「處理中」，而且它的後台完全沒有可以選擇訂單狀態的控制項——只有「標記為完成」、「取消訂單」這類固定按鈕——所以這個外掛同時補上保護機制與控制項。"

#: src/Admin/AdminMenu.php:294
msgid "Adds the shipping statuses “In production” and “Shipment scheduled” between the built-in Unshipped and Shipped. FluentCart’s built-in statuses keep their own names, and nothing you have already set up is overwritten."
msgstr "在內建的「未出貨」與「已出貨」之間加入「下生產」與「排定出貨」兩個出貨狀態。FluentCart 的內建狀態保留原本的名稱，已經設定好的內容也不會被覆寫。"

#: src/Admin/AdminMenu.php:418
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "進階"

#: src/Admin/AdminMenu.php:419
msgid "The defaults suit almost every shop: the status is offered on every order, and it stays put when a payment lands."
msgstr "預設值適合幾乎所有商店：這個狀態適用所有訂單，收到款項時也會保持不變。"

#: src/Admin/AdminMenu.php:445
msgid "Set by FluentCart when a payment is recorded"
msgstr "收到款項時由 FluentCart 設定"

